event: sections
data: ["# Easy to use and privacy-friendly Google Analytics alternative\n\nPlausible is powerful, lightweight analytics. No cookies, just insights. Made and hosted in the EU, powered by European-owned infrastructure. 🇪🇺\n\n[Start free trial](/register)\n\n[View live demo](/plausible.io)","## Why use Plausible Analytics?\n\nGoogle Analytics is overkill for most site owners. Plausible gives you clear, useful insights without complexity, training or prior analytics experience.\n\nAutomatic scroll depth tracking\n:   Scroll depth from 1 to 100 percent is tracked automatically on every page. No setup, no tag managers. Create scroll depth goals without code.\n\nMonitor traffic from AI tools\n:   See which AI tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, or Claude send you traffic. Identify pages that attract AI visitors and the conversions they complete.\n\nAnalyze SEO performance\n:   Connect Search Console to see search queries and organic performance directly in your Plausible dashboard. Track SEO content and conversions in one place.\n\nMeasure paid ads and campaigns\n:   Track UTM campaigns with automatic channel grouping for Paid Search or Affiliates. Analyze landing pages, conversions and locations.\n\nReal-time dashboard\n:   Monitor live traffic with the same metrics as your main dashboard. Updates every 30 seconds without refreshing the page.\n\nCodeless goals and revenue tracking\n:   Turn any page into a goal. Automatically track file downloads, form completions and external link clicks. Set up custom events and revenue tracking.\n\nFunnels and user journeys\n:   Measure drop-off across a fixed sequence of steps. Or explore the paths visitors actually take to discover flows you didn't predict.\n\nBuilt-in bot filtering\n:   Exclude bots, referrer spam and data center traffic so your stats reflect real human visits, out of the box.","## People ❤️ Plausible\n\nPlausible runs reliably at any scale, from small sites to hundreds of millions of monthly visitors, and is trusted by thousands of companies that have switched from Google Analytics.\n\nPaying subscribers\n:   21k\n\nTracked pageviews\n:   313B\n\nUptime (Last 90 days)\n:   99.99%\n\n[Clem Delangue\n\nCo-founder and CEO at Hugging Face](https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7297550772177682434?commentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Acomment%3A%28activity%3A7297550772177682434%2C7297619729920196608%29&dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287297619729920196608%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7297550772177682434%29)\n\nWe’re massive users of Plausible here at Hugging Face.\n\n[DHH\n\nCo-founder and CTO at 37signals](https://twitter.com/dhh/status/1438785402576506884)\n\nBeen a very happy customer of Plausible at Basecamp. Wonderful to see domains like web stats that were once a wasteland due to monopoly weight spring new, better options ❤️\n\n[John O'Nolan\n\nFounder and CEO at Ghost](https://twitter.com/JohnONolan/status/1488921946062569480)\n\nCheck out Plausible if you haven't yet - fantastic product. We switched over everything from GA.\n\n[Cyrus Shepard\n\nSEO consultant and former Moz lead](https://twitter.com/cyrusshepard/status/1714380470862131344)\n\nMy 100% favorite GA4 alternative so far is Plausible. Not free and not a ton of bells and whistles, but SOOOO easy to use (for clients too) and the data is near real-time. A good solution for ~70% of websites struggling with GA4.\n\n[Rob Hope\n\nProduct designer and founder](https://twitter.com/robhope/status/1351465826109558784)\n\nJust replaced my full network's Google Analytics with Plausible - I can't remember when last I was this impressed by a SaaS UX + design 💯  \n  \nBecame a paying customer within 1hr of the 30-day trial.\n\n[Laura Roeder\n\nFounder at Paperbell](https://x.com/lkr/status/1792637010567385355)\n\nI've been super happy with Plausible. All the conversion tracking we need, it has every report we use.","## It's time to ditch Google Analytics\n\nGoogle Analytics is frustrating to use, difficult to understand, slow to load and privacy-invasive. That's why we built Plausible Analytics, a simple, privacy-first alternative that doesn't cut corners.\n\nHere's what makes Plausible a great [Google Analytics alternative](/vs-google-analytics) and why over 21,000 paying customers trust us with their website and business insights:","### Simple analytics at a glance\n\nPlausible is [simple web analytics](/simple-web-analytics). It is easy to understand and cuts through the noise. Check your site traffic and get the essential insights on one page in one minute. Get an aggregated view of all your sites in a consolidated dashboard. There are no layers of menus and no need to build custom reports, custom dashboards or PowerPoint documents. You can even import your Google Analytics stats.","### Lightweight script that keeps your site speed fast\n\nPlausible is [lightweight web analytics](/lightweight-web-analytics). Our script is 54 times smaller than Google Analytics. Every visitor that loads your site downloads 135KB less JavaScript. Less data transferred means less energy used and less carbon emitted, for every visitor, every day. A site with 100,000 monthly visitors saves around 4 kg of CO2 per year by switching.","### No need for cookie banners or GDPR consent\n\nPlausible is [privacy-friendly web analytics](/privacy-focused-web-analytics) that doesn't process personal data or track individual users. No cookies, no persistent identifiers, no cross-site or cross-device tracking. Your site data is not used for any other purposes. All visitor data is exclusively processed on servers owned and operated by European companies and never leaves the EU.\n\nWe invite you to take a look around, explore our [live demo](/plausible.io) and [try Plausible](/register) for free. We'd be honored to have you as a customer. Thank you.\n\nUku and Marko  \n Co-founders\n\nP.S. We're a completely independent, self-funded, bootstrapped and profitable team of 10, running since 2018. No outside investors, no acquisition targets. We choose the subscription business model rather than surveillance capitalism. Our code is open source too, so you're never locked in. Read more [about us](/about).","## Traffic based plans that match your growth\n\nSign up for 30-day free trial. No credit card required.\n\n2 months free\n\nUp to **10k** monthly pageviews\n\n10k10M+","### Starter\n\n/year /month\n\n$9  /month\n\nStart free trial\n\n* One site\n* 3 years of data retention\n* Intuitive, fast and privacy-friendly dashboard\n* Email/Slack reports\n* Google Analytics import\n* Goals and custom events\n* Saved Segments\n* Annotations","### Growth\n\n/year /month\n\n$14  /month\n\nCustom\n\nStart free trial\n\n* Everything in Starter\n* Up to 3 sites\n* Up to 3 team members\n* Team Management\n* Shared Links\n* Embedded Dashboards\n* Shared Segments\n* Shared Annotations","### Business\n\n/year /month\n\n$19  /month\n\nCustom\n\nStart free trial\n\n* Everything in Growth\n* Up to 10 sites\n* Up to 10 team members\n* 5 years of data retention\n* Custom Properties\n* Stats API (600 requests per hour)\n* Data Studio Connector\n* Ecommerce revenue attribution\n* Funnels and user journeys\n* Consolidated View","### Enterprise\n\nCustom\n\n [Contact us](/contact) \n\n* Everything in Business\n* 10+ sites\n* 10+ team members\n* 600+ Stats API requests per hour\n* Sites API access\n* Single Sign-On (SSO)\n* Managed Proxy\n* Scheduled raw event data exports\n* 5+ years of data retention\n* Priority support","### Ready to ditch Google Analytics? Start your free trial today\n\n[Start free trial](/register)\n\n[View live demo](/plausible.io)\n\n#### \n\n[Made and hosted in the EU 🇪🇺](/eu-hosted-web-analytics)  \n Funded entirely by our subscribers.\n\n#### Why Plausible?\n\n* [Simple metrics](/simple-web-analytics)\n* [Lightweight script](/lightweight-web-analytics)\n* [Privacy focused](/privacy-focused-web-analytics)\n* [Open source](/open-source-website-analytics)\n* [No cookie banner](/cookieless-web-analytics)\n* [Features](/features)\n* [Ecommerce](/for-ecommerce)\n* [SaaS](/for-saas)\n* [Publishers](/for-bloggers-creators)\n* [Agencies](/for-freelancers-agencies)\n* [Public sector](/for-public-sector)\n* [White label](/white-label-web-analytics)\n* [Enterprise](/enterprise-web-analytics)\n\n#### Explore\n\n* [vs Google Analytics](/vs-google-analytics)\n* [Migrate from GA4](/migrate-from-google-analytics)\n* [vs Matomo](/vs-matomo)\n* [vs Cloudflare](/vs-cloudflare-web-analytics)\n* [GA4 accuracy](/most-accurate-web-analytics)\n* [Paid vs free](/paid-analytics-vs-free-ga)\n* [Right for you?](/when-not-to-use-plausible)\n* [How to choose](/privacy-friendly-web-analytics)\n* [WordPress plugin](/wordpress-analytics-plugin)\n* [Google Tag Manager](/gtm-template)\n* [Data Studio](/looker-studio-connector)\n* [NPM package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@plausible-analytics/tracker)\n\n#### Resources\n\n* [Documentation](/docs)\n* [Blog](/blog)\n* [Tools](/tools)\n* [What's new](/changelog)\n* [Status](/status)\n* [GitHub](https://github.com/plausible/analytics)\n* [X (Twitter)](https://twitter.com/plausiblehq)\n* [Bluesky](https://bsky.app/profile/plausible.io)\n* [Mastodon](https://fosstodon.org/@plausible)\n* [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/plausible-analytics/)\n\n#### Company\n\n* [About](/about)\n* [Pricing](/#pricing)\n* [Contact](/contact)\n* [Privacy policy](/privacy)\n* [Data policy](/data-policy)\n* [Terms](/terms)\n* [DPA](/dpa)\n* [Security](/security)\n* [Compliance](/compliance)\n* [Procurement](/procurement)\n* [Imprint](/imprint)"]

